<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@/~cl_18> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "18" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@> .
