<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong Bahagian IV dan IVA. Pindaan seksyen 125"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@/~cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@> .
