<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@/~cl_9> <https://schema.org/name> "Seksyen 126 Akta ibu dipinda—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@/~cl_9__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@/~cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/12/msa@> .
